 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\nConvert that to minutes:\n\n$$\n7 \\times 60 + 55 = 420 + 55 = 475 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### **Step 3: Account for the time she was sleepwalking**\n\nShe **sleepwalked from 2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.** \u2014 that is:\n\n$$\n2:38 \\text{ a.m.} - 2:15 \\text{ a.m.} = 23 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\nSo, during that time, she was **not sleeping on her bed** \u2014 she was **sleepwalking**.\n\n---\n\n### **Step 4: Subtract sleepwalking time from total sleep time**\n\nTotal sleep time (on her bed) = total time she was asleep - time she was sleepwalking\n\n$$\n475 \\text{ minutes} - 23 \\text{ minutes} = 452 \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Final Answer:**\n\n$$\n\\boxed{452} \\text{ minutes}\n$$\n\nKim slept on her bed for **452 minutes** that day.", "decode_seconds": 5.143542156089097, "draft_calls": 142, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 139, "mapper_checkpoint_sha256": "b4562dc664748ec2da6e0f1ccac13820bfd0fa9c413a7a3235ebec5f1d84b613", "method": "relay_base", "output_hash": "dd8e7096c2626ece848237d91cb0c1fbb1768d7a8ea77cd9cd6865e3dc92b907", "output_tokens": 565, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20661724160, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20916994048, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1695cf1a111991fc", "profile_regions_ms": {"draft": 754.6992354393005, "prefill_full_target": 37.73430252075195, "prefill_relay": 0.2503359913825989, "relay": 39.24486409127712, "unattributed_runtime": 74.03326042741537, "verification_full_target": 4277.837526321411}, "proposal_lengths": [15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15, 15