an usual.**  \n  So her wake-up time was **6:00 a.m. - 5 minutes = 5:55 a.m.**\n\n- **She sleepwalked from 2:15 a.m. to 2:38 a.m.**  \n  That\u2019s **23 minutes** of sleepwalking.\n\n---\n\n### **3. Total time from 10:00 p.m. to 5:55 a.m. (her wake-up time):**\nLet\u2019s calculate how long that is.\n\n- From **10:00 p.m. to 6:00 a.m.** is **8 hours = 480 minutes**\n- She woke up **5 minutes earlier**, so total time she was in bed:  \n  **480 minutes - 5 minutes = 475 minutes**\n\n---\n\n### **4. However, she was sleepwalking for 23 minutes.**\n- During that time, she was **not sleeping** on her bed.\n- So, we need to **subtract those 23 minutes** from the total time in bed.\n\n---\n\n### **5. Final calculation:**\n- Total time in bed: **475 minutes**\n- Sleepwalking time: **23 minutes**\n- **Time she actually slept on her bed:**  \n  $$\n  475 - 23 = \\boxed{452} \\text{ minutes}\n  $$\n\n---\n\n### \u2705 **Answer:**  \n$$\n\\boxed{452} \\text{ minutes}\n$$", "decode_seconds": 12.192525275051594, "draft_calls": 0, "event": "benchmark_row", "input_tokens": 139, "method": "native_ar", "output_hash": "210dbd38fb57598e3e5ab0cd99916616c60319e78bf31703bf8dabd82af80698", "output_tokens": 466, "peak_allocated_memory_bytes": 20561936384, "peak_reserved_memory_bytes": 20916994048, "problem_id": "gsm8k/1695cf1a111991fc", "profile_regions_ms": {"unattributed_runtime": 12228.279953356832}, "rank": 0, "reference_answer": "452", "repetition": 0, "request_seconds": 12.228279953356832, "reserved_memory_after_bytes": 20916994048, "reserved_memory_before_bytes": 20916994048, "sampling_seed": 5993651088019953431, "sampling_temperature": 0.6, "target_calls": 466, "time_to_first_token_seconds": 0.03427185397595167, "turn_index": 0}
